# Effect previews: 131 effects x 16 frames of 320x180 PNG is ~175MB, and
# PNGs do not delta-compress, so every regeneration would add that again
# to the history. They are a build artifact — deterministic from the
# profile, two minutes of GPU to remake (`just effect-previews`) — and a
# missing one degrades to a row with no thumbnail rather than an error.
# The looks' four stills stay committed; they are a quarter of a megabyte.
data/effects/previews/
data/macros/previews/
